# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# The /audit/ URL structure was renamed to /tools/ so the free tools section
# can expand beyond audits (generators, converters, etc.) without a second
# restructure. 301 redirects preserve any external backlinks to the old URLs
# and pass full SEO equity to the new paths.

/audit/restaurants/   /tools/restaurant-audit/   301
/audit/               /tools/                    301
/audit/*              /tools/:splat              301
